### FieldTrack API — REST Client Test File
### Use with VS Code "REST Client" extension or import into Postman.
### Set @token after running the login request.

@base = http://localhost:3001
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@attendance_id = 1
@visit_id = 1
@dealer_id = 3

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Health
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 4: Auth
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login as rep (Arun Kumar)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arun.kumar",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login as manager
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "manager",
  "password": "manager123"
}

###

### Login — wrong password (expect 401)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "arun.kumar",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

###

### Refresh access token
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE"
}

###

### Hit protected route WITHOUT token (expect 401)
GET {{base}}/api/attendance/today

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 5: Dealers
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all dealers
GET {{base}}/api/dealers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Search dealers
GET {{base}}/api/dealers?search=kovai
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 5: Attendance (full day flow)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Step 1: Day check-in (Gandhipuram Coimbatore coords)
POST {{base}}/api/attendance/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lat": 11.0168,
  "lng": 76.9558
}

###

### Step 2: Get today's attendance state
GET {{base}}/api/attendance/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Step 3: Dealer check-in at Kovai Steel Traders (dealer_id=3)
### Use attendance_id returned from Step 1
POST {{base}}/api/visits/check-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendance_id": {{attendance_id}},
  "dealer_id": {{dealer_id}},
  "lat": 11.0168,
  "lng": 76.9558
}

###

### Step 4: Dealer check-out (within radius)
POST {{base}}/api/visits/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": {{visit_id}},
  "lat": 11.0168,
  "lng": 76.9558
}

###

### Step 4b: Dealer check-out OUTSIDE radius — missing justification (expect 400)
POST {{base}}/api/visits/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": {{visit_id}},
  "lat": 12.9716,
  "lng": 77.5946
}

###

### Step 4c: Dealer check-out OUTSIDE radius — WITH justification (should succeed)
POST {{base}}/api/visits/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visit_id": {{visit_id}},
  "lat": 12.9716,
  "lng": 77.5946,
  "justification_note": "Meeting moved to client office on short notice"
}

###

### Step 5: Day check-out
POST {{base}}/api/attendance/check-out
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "attendance_id": {{attendance_id}},
  "lat": 11.0168,
  "lng": 76.9558
}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Stage 10: Dashboard (manager-only)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard — login as manager first, use manager token
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Dashboard — try with rep token (expect 403)
GET {{base}}/api/dashboard/today
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
